    "Soak in salt water for 30 minutes to remove dirt and insects",
    "Slice lengthwise and rinse thoroughly inside the hollow stem",
    "Sauté in garlic-infused oil for FODMAP-friendly flavor",
    "Cook thoroughly as raw morels can cause digestive upset"
